; Specification: ETSI TS 183 017
; Version: 3.2.1
; Vendor-ID: 13019
; Bases: RFC6733
; Link: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/183000_183099/183017/03.02.01_60/ts_183017v030201p.pdf
