Binding-information              450    7.3.1     Grouped      V      -     -       M       Yes
Binding-input-list               451    7.3.2     Grouped      V      -     -       M       Yes
Binding-output-list              452    7.3.3     Grouped      V      -     -       M       Yes
V6-transport-address             453    7.3.4     Grouped      V      -     -       M       Yes
V4-transport-address             454    7.3.5     Grouped      V      -     -       M       Yes
Port-number                      455    7.3.6     Unsigned32   V      -     -       M       Yes
Reservation-class                456    7.3.7     Unsigned32   V      -     -       M       Yes
Latching-indication              457    7.3.8     Enumerated   V      -     -       M       Yes
Reservation-priority             458    7.3.9     Enumerated   V      -     -       M       Yes
Service-Class                    459    7.3.33    UTF8String   V      -     -       M       Yes
