Media-Authorization-Context-Id   462    7.3.38    UTF8String   V      -     -       M       Yes
Overbooking-indicator            460    7.3.35    Enumerated   V      -     -       M       Yes
;; NOTE 1: The AVP header bit denoted as "M", indicates whether support of the AVP is required. The AVP header bit denoted as "V", indicates whether the optional Vendor-ID field is present in the AVP header. For further details, see RFC 3588 [3].
;; NOTE 2: The value types are defined in RFC 3588 [3].


